prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-literals-regular-expression-literals spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-performeval
script: eval("/a[bc\\")
note: correspondence row S9b: direct: RegularExpressionLiteral's own grammar refuses the source, a SyntaxError; the expected value is read from the clauses, which regexpref does not model
since: 31

